      "sentence": "Speech-to-text for ESP32/ESP32-S3 using Groq's ultra-fast Whisper API.",
      "paragraph": "Streaming voice recognition library for ESP32 and ESP32-S3 with INMP441 I2S microphones. Records and uploads simultaneously (no PSRAM or audio buffering needed), with built-in filtering, silence detection, opt-in voice-activity detection for hands-free auto-stop, blocking and non-blocking APIs, file/buffer transcription, translation and verbose JSON output with segment timestamps. Works with Arduino IDE and PlatformIO.",
      "category": "Communication",
      "architectures": [
        "esp32"
      ],
      "depends": [
        "ArduinoJson"
